OL,3,GNEWSANew investigators to support city
OL,4,Acrime crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree new investigators are being
OL,7,Ffunded to support police in tackling
OL,8,Fretail crime in Nottingham.
OL,10,FThe city council has approved #157,000
OL,11,Fto fund the police staff investigators
OL,12,F(PSIs) to work alongside neighbourhood
OL,13,Fpolicing teams and focus on gathering
OL,14,Fevidence and making sure cases move
OL,15,Fthrough the courts as quickly as
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
