OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANew investigators to support city
OL,4,Acrime crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlong with a fourth post already
OL,7,Fcreated, officials said the team will
OL,8,Fboost dedicated investigative capacity
OL,9,Fin the city centre, making sure
OL,10,Fsuspects are dealt with and freeing up
OL,11,Fofficers to respond to issues on the
OL,12,Fground.
OL,14,FNottinghamshire Police said the
OL,15,Finitiative would be a "huge benefit for
OL,16,Four retail community who are being
OL,17,Ftargeted by shoplifters".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
